vLLM-HUST Native BF16 Greedy Sampling MOD

This repository contains a patch for the Apache-2.0-licensed vLLM Ascend
rejection sampler in the frozen vLLM-HUST R10 engine. The patch and its
support tooling are distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Original file notices remain in the resulting source.

